---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  seo={{
    title: "Privacy Policy and Data Protection Practices",
    description: "Read how PraveenTechWorld protects your privacy. Learn what data we collect, how we use cookies, and your rights regarding your personal information.",
  }}
>
  <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
      PraveenTechWorld respects your privacy. This policy explains how we handle
      your information.
    </p>
    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We do not collect personal information directly. We use standard web
      analytics to understand how visitors use our site, including page views,
      referring sites, and browser type. This data is anonymized and cannot be
      traced back to you.
    </p>
    <h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
    <p>
      We use cookies and similar technologies to enhance site functionality,
      such as storing your theme preference (light or dark mode), and to analyze
      traffic.
    </p>
    <p>
      Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a
      user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of
      advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users
      based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
    </p>
    <p>
      Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting{" "}
      <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Google Ads Settings
      </a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of third-party vendor cookies for
      personalized advertising by visiting{" "}
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        www.aboutads.info
      </a>{" "}
      or{" "}
      <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Your Online Choices
      </a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      Analytics data is retained for 26 months before automatic deletion. If you
      contact us via email, we keep your message and contact details only as long
      as needed to address your inquiry, after which they are deleted.
    </p>
    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on your location, you may have rights under GDPR or CCPA,
      including the right to access, correct, or delete your data. Since we do
      not collect personal data directly, these rights are generally managed
      through the analytics and advertising providers. You can opt out of analytics
      tracking and personalized advertising by adjusting your browser settings or
      cookie consent preferences.
    </p>
    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      We use Vercel for hosting, Google Analytics (GA4) for aggregated site traffic
      measurement, and Google AdSense for advertising display. Each third-party
      provider maintains its own privacy policy governing data handling.
    </p>
    <h2>Updates</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy as needed. Changes will be posted on this page
      with an updated date. Continued use of the site after changes takes effect
      constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Email{" "}
      <a href="mailto:contact@praveentechworld.com">contact@praveentechworld.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
